Z||000000||88 Fiero GT Turbo||11-25-2000||01:32 PM||||I am thinking of selling my fiero.  It is a 88 GT Turbo 5 speed.  The car is red.  It has been lowered 1.5" and has Knoi adjustable shocks.  It has 16" Centerline rims with 16x8 in the rear and 16x7 in the front.  the rims do not stick out passed the fenders. The turbo is a Miller Woods system(Design One is the same).  The thing is I put $2500.00 into a new turbo and rebuilt the transmission and then I bent a valve in the middle cyclender towards the back of the car and the car has been sitting for 2 years now.  I was wondering what kind of offers that I would get.  Any questions feel free to ask. <P>Later,<BR>Jack<P>88 Fiero GT Turbo<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/10_10.jpg"> <p>[This message has been edited by 88 Fiero GT Turbo (edited 11-25-2000).]||||reg||5
