Z||000008||StuGood||11-26-2000||01:13 PM||||Well, since you asked...  if it looks as good inside as it does outside, clear title, (almost) everything works, and assuming it won't run (or runs badly) w/ the bent valve, I probably wouldn't hesitate to offer something like $3600.<P>...hope that's not a slap, but I'm cheap, and you asked  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif">  <P>So- 1)Does it run and/or drive?  2)Why don't you move it here to Wichita, so I can look at it in person  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif">?||||reg||3
Z||000009||88 Fiero GT Turbo||11-26-2000||01:59 PM||||It does start up and drives.  It has a new battery, alternater(spelled wrong),and water pump.  I keep up with my cars.  <P>You would have to come to me it you want to see it and bring cash$$$$$$$.<P>Later,<BR>Jack||||reg||1
Z||000010||StuGood||11-26-2000||02:47 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by 88 Fiero GT Turbo:<BR><B>...new battery, alternater(spelled wrong),and water pump...</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Nope, sorry, I just wouldn't be able to convince myself into buying a car if its alternator was spelled wrong...  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><P>Unfortunately, the chances of me showing up in R.I. are just about zero.  I just asked myself what I'd probably be willing to offer if a car like that ever showed up here in town, and that's what I came up with.  <P>Not trying to play with you or anything - just trying to answer your question  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">.<P>BTW, if you <B>do</B> try to sell it, somebody's bound to ask you, "How do you know there's a bent valve?," and "Does the A/C work?"   <BR>||||reg||1
