Z||000012||88 Fiero GT Turbo||11-26-2000||03:54 PM||||The car has about 93,000 miles on it.  The a/c does work and had it charged before I let it sit.  The condition of the ball joints and bushins I am not sure of but the car handled like a dream.  It does need tires they got alittle dry rotted sitin all this time.  No accidents that I know of.  The car is strait as an arrow.  I was on route 195 and laid into her and she started runnin real bad and it just happened.  Really not sure.<P>Later,<BR>Jack<BR>||||reg||1
