Z||000016||jerpro||11-27-2000||12:03 PM||||your car is sellable. If it wasn't b/cause I was drooling over the "purple pavement eater" I would consider your car.<BR>You should of put it for sale some time back though. A car sitting two years in good condition or not is going to require some extensive maintenance.<BR>I would tune uo the car, get it as good as you can and not sell it for less than 5k. <BR>If you sell it for less you are getting ripped off.<BR><P>------------------<BR>Only try your best, and if you don't succeed... TRY HARDER.||||reg||6
